<title>POLAND: Bouygues to build new PBR office.</title>
<headline>Bouygues to build new PBR office.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Bouygues and its Polish unit, Bouygues Polska SA, signed a $24.7 million contract to plan and construct a new office building for Polski Bank Rozwoju SA (PBR), the bank said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The statement said the investment would take 18 months to complete. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
